# Installation Scheduler - Setup & Teardown Scheduling
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Generate installation schedule - Project 1 (London Gala)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/1

### 2. Generate schedule - Project 2 (Dubai outdoor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/2

### 3. Generate schedule - Project 3 (New York)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/3

### 4. Regenerate schedule with latest weather forecast
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule/1/regenerate

### 5. Regenerate Dubai schedule (high-stakes outdoor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule/2/regenerate

### 6. Error case - schedule for non-existent project
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule/999